{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_chat_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "c03565c6079977033152429ea51807fc859baf082460c91366971d8df86ee4db", "ja": "最近、エアコンの調子が\n悪くて困っちゃうなぁ…。\nうう、ムシムシする…。", "zh": "最近空调怪怪的，\n真伤脑筋……\n呜呜，好热喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "0267bec89cee68c22c69304f1459cf1b4a324924b57cff4a37f81d75339275d4", "ja": "こんな時、劇場に扇風機が\nあればなぁ。…あっ、\n扇風機で思い出したけど…。", "zh": "这种时候，\n要是剧场里有电风扇就好了。\n……啊，说起电风扇我就想到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "9daf7ea189031001e359d56cca5d621a76094f24398ede1d922491e09f84d701", "ja": "昔、お姉ちゃんと一緒に、扇風機に\n向かって「ワレワレハ宇宙人ダ」\nなんて言って遊んでたっけ。", "zh": "以前我还会跟姊姊一起，\n对着电风扇玩起\n说「我们是外星人」的游戏呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "54e408f394b6e97de3bbd5b30b5caa6d1da0f386554f59b72f86cd1c60a3dabb", "ja": "えへへ、懐かしいなっ。\n…今度、家でやってみようかな？", "zh": "嘿嘿，好怀念喔。\n……下次在家里试试看好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
